Q4. How do SRP, OCP, LSP and ISP work together
in a real-world application?

Interview Ready Answer

Example

Online Payment System

------------------------------------------------------------

SRP

Each class has one responsibility.

PaymentService

↓

Processes Payment

EmailService

↓

Sends Email

PaymentRepository

↓

Stores Payment Details

------------------------------------------------------------

OCP

New payment methods are added
without modifying existing code.

Payment

↓

UPIPayment

↓

CardPayment

↓

WalletPayment

↓

NetBankingPayment

------------------------------------------------------------

LSP

Every payment implementation
can replace another.

Payment payment=new UpiPayment();

↓

Payment payment=new CardPayment();

Client code remains unchanged.

------------------------------------------------------------

ISP

Instead of one large interface,

Split it into

Payable

↓

pay()

----------------

Refundable

↓

refund()

----------------

InvoiceGenerator

↓

generateInvoice()

Each class implements only
the interfaces it requires.

